{"displayStem":"29세 여자가 소량 질출혈로 병원에 왔다. 혈압 112/72mmHg, 맥박 78회/분이다. 복막 자극 소견은 없고 추적 진료가 가능하다. 질초음파 판독과 연속 hCG 자료는 다음과 같다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>동일 검사실 추적</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"동일 검사실 추적。첫 채혈 후 시간 (h)、hCG (IU/L)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">hCG (IU/L)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">90</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">120</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">625</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">1250</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1875</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">2500</text><polyline points=\"76,160.792 252,137.824 428,123.556\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"160.792\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"137.824\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"428\" cy=\"123.556\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">환자</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">첫 채혈 후 시간 (h)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>관찰</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>자궁 내 임신낭</td><td>확인되지 않음</td></tr><tr><td>명확한 부속기 임신낭</td><td>확인되지 않음</td></tr><tr><td>복강 내 다량 액체</td><td>없음</td></tr><tr><td>현재 심한 통증·실신</td><td>없음</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}